        "kind": "custom",
        "note": "Daylight and sky: a cool near-white page, white cards, ink-navy as the action and one sky blue as the signal, with mint as its partner in charts. Read off a Korean startup-legal marketing site (2026-09-18) as colour values only — the pale sky gradients, the frosted chips over photographs and the near-black pill button. Dark is a designed counterpart: a deep blue-charcoal night, not an inverted page."
